e:"Try sending your message again.",id:"0hzmTPDdkC"},tryAgainOrReport:{defaultMessage:"Try sending your message again. If it keeps happening, share feedback so we can investigate.",id:"wSIy1+/HLg"},reinstall:{defaultMessage:"The Claude Code binary is missing or damaged. Reinstall Claude Desktop to continue.",id:"E9ffNa95kd"},reinstallArch:{defaultMessage:"The Claude Code binary doesn't match this computer's architecture. Reinstall Claude Desktop for your platform.",id:"hZ2DipvK2w"},restartApp:{defaultMessage:"Restarting Claude Desktop may resolve this.",id:"B6F2sC7pVE"},signIn:{defaultMessage:"Sign in again to continue.",id:"p0Vi703w32"},githubAuth:{defaultMessage:"Your GitHub credentials were rejected. Reconnect GitHub to continue.",id:"1HLmdzwR9I"},rateLimit:{defaultMessage:"You've reached your usage limit. Try again after your limit resets.",id:"HfMQVThKYy"},network:{defaultMessage:"Check your internet connection, VPN, or proxy and try again.",id:"Wb/3E+ALRw"},networkServiceDead:{defaultMessage:"Reconnection failed. Restart Claude Desktop, then try again.",id:"a5VS4oqqOK"},connectionRefused:{defaultMessage:"Check that your SSH host or local proxy is reachable, then try again.",id:"whFH9beKiB"},proxyUnreachable:{defaultMessage:"Claude Code is configured to use an HTTPS proxy that couldn't reach Anthropic's API. Check that the proxy is running, or add api.anthropic.com to NO_PROXY in the same settings file.",id:"X9oat/xfAA"},resumeNotFound:{defaultMessage:"This session's conversation history is no longer on disk. You can keep working here \u2014 sending your message will start a fresh session in this folder.",id:"a56TLh4QPs"},folderNotFound:{defaultMessage:"This session's working folder no longer exists. Choose a different folder or start a new session.",id:"21CV5Tczjm"},folderAccessDenied:{defaultMessage:"Claude can't read this folder. Grant access in System Settings \u2192 Privacy & Security \u2192 Files and Folders.",id:"hIatmGaemL"},cloudSyncFolder:{defaultMessage:'macOS blocked Claude from reading this folder. Try granting "Full Disk Access" to the Claude app and restarting, or select a different working folder.',id:"g9WJUWrdFw"},gitRequired:{defaultMessage:"Install Git (Xcode Command Line Tools on macOS, Git for Windows on Windows) to continue.",id:"SuGpwv1fKH"},endpointSecurity:{defaultMessage:"Your endpoint-security software blocked Claude Code. Ask your IT team to allowlist signing Team ID Q6L2SF6YDW.",id:"k6ld7Mp5ii"},appControlBlocked:{defaultMessage:"WDAC, AppLocker, or endpoint protection is preventing the workspace runtime from starting. Copy the details for the binary path and policy rule needed to allowlist it.",id:"Y0/NpCBqzJ"},osTooOld:{defaultMessage:"Claude Code requires a newer version of macOS. Update macOS to continue.",id:"KtH0oCK2rM"},dllNotFound:{defaultMessage:"A Windows system library is missing. Reinstall Claude Desktop or repair the Visual C++ Redistributable.",id:"KTSbDsrJwt"},diskError:{defaultMessage:"Reading or writing the session folder failed. Check disk space and permissions, then try again.",id:"JkbN+kWYy3"},unexpectedOutput:{defaultMessage:"A shell hook or tool wrote unexpected output. Check your shell startup files and Claude Code hooks for stray stdout writes.",id:"bmH8vfWbiu"},trustRequired:{defaultMessage:"Approve this folder in the trust prompt to continue.",id:"DZwrOk9TjA"},nestedSession:{defaultMessage:"Claude Code can't run inside another Claude Code session. Close the outer session to continue.",id:"U8DVwUsvy2"},bypassGateBlocked:{defaultMessage:"Claude Code refused to start in Bypass Permissions mode on this machine. The session has been switched to Accept Edits \u2014 send your message again to continue.",id:"u+b+OpBo2Z"},otelExporter:{defaultMessage:"An OTEL console exporter in settings.json is interfering with Claude Code. Remove the OTEL_*_EXPORTER=console setting.",id:"lY2D3mXwpE"},bridgeOffline:{defaultMessage:"Your terminal's Claude Code session stopped responding. Check your terminal for errors, then resend your message.",id:"zaPxGqzW4A"},sshDisconnected:{defaultMessage:"The SSH connection dropped and auto-reconnect didn't succeed. Your session is preserved on the remote host \u2014 resend your message to reconnect and pick up where you left off. If it keeps failing, check that the host is reachable (VPN, network) and your SSH agent is unlocked.",id:"RtSXJpna/C"},rewindTargetNotFound:{defaultMessage:"That point in the conversation couldn't be found. Send your message again to continue the session.",id:"pPg+NzFStg"},gitCheckoutFailed:{defaultMessage:"Commit or stash changes, or check your repository for issues like a missing branch, locked files, or Git LFS setup.",id:"nZAVyUccg2"},remoteWorktreeFailed:{defaultMessage:"Check disk space and the repository on that machine, then try again.",id:"sThS3jTs5d"},policyDenied:{defaultMessage:"Your organization's policy has blocked access to this folder. Choose a folder inside an allowed workspace, or contact your IT team.",id:"/zBewcOy3f"},binaryLocked:{defaultMessage:"Another program (e.g. antivirus) has a temporary lock on app files. Wait a moment and try again.",id:"4w2mdIEQf/"},bypassRootBlocked:{defaultMessage:"Bypass Permissions can't be used with root/sudo. Run as a non-root user, or turn off Bypass Permissions in settings.",id:"kCKK+84T6p"},settingsWriteDenied:{defaultMessage:"Claude Code couldn't write its settings file to the temporary directory. Check that the temp directory is writable, or adjust the sandbox policy.",id:"cflWd3GEL5"},cliFlagUnsupported:{defaultMessage:"The installed Claude Code version doesn't support a feature this app uses. Update Claude Code on this host.",id:"eV/BNCIRzM"},remoteSpawnFailed:{defaultMessage:"The Claude Code binary on the remote host is missing. Send your message again to redeploy it.",id:"DolRxwrLXf"},remoteFolderNotFound:{defaultMessage:"This session's working folder no longer exists on the remote host. Recreate it there, or start a new session in a different folder.",id:"QrAsRXS0kX"},remoteFolderNotFoundFork:{defaultMessage:"This session's worktree was removed on the remote host. Fork the session to continue this conversation in a fresh worktree.",id:"oPXeOoRDu+"}}),oct=NO({startFresh:{defaultMessage:"Start fresh",id:"x8pR5jrE+w"}}),lct={sdk_binary_missing:{title:ict.cliCouldntStart,body:rct.reinstall,retryHelps:!1},sdk_binary_arch_mismatch:{title:ict.cliCouldntStart,body:rct.reinstallArch,retryHelps:!1},sdk_binary_corrupt:{title:ict.cliCouldntStart,body:rct.tryAgain,retryHelps:!0},disclaimer_binary_missing:{title:ict.cliCouldntStart,body:rct.reinstall,retryHelps:!1},spawn_failed:{title:ict.cliCouldntStart,body:rct.restartApp,retryHelps:!0},segfault:{title:ict.cliCrashed,body:rct.tryAgainOrReport,retryHelps:!0},process_crashed:{title:ict.cliCrashed,body:rct.tryAgainOrReport,retryHelps:!0},renderer_cascade:{title:ict.interrupted,body:rct.tryAgain,retryHelps:!0},process_interrupted:{title:ict.interrupted,body:rct.tryAgain,retryHelps:!0},endpoint_security_blocked:{title:ict.endpointSecurity,body:rct.endpointSecurity,retryHelps:!1},app_control_blocked:{title:ict.appControlBlocked,body:rct.appControlBlocked,retryHelps:!1,copyDetails:'Claude\'s workspace runtime failed to start with errno -4094 (spawn UNKNOWN).\n\nThis is usually WDAC, AppLocker, or antivirus/endpoint protection blocking execution of the runtime binary, which is downloaded under the user profile:\n\n  %LOCALAPPDATA%\\Claude-3p\\claude-code\\<version>\\claude.exe   (third-party deployment)\n  %APPDATA%\\Claude\\claude-code\\<version>\\claude.exe           (standard deployment)\n\nThe runtime also spawns ripgrep (rg.exe) from the same directory.\n\nTo confirm which control is blocking it, check Event Viewer:\n  - WDAC:       Applications and Services Logs > Microsoft > Windows > CodeIntegrity > Operational, Event ID 3077\n  - AppLocker:  Applications and Services Logs > Microsoft > Windows > AppLocker > EXE and DLL, Event ID 8004\n  - Defender:   Applications and Services Logs > Microsoft > Windows > Windows Defender > Operational, Event ID 1116 / 1117\n\nTo fix, add a publisher rule for "Anthropic, PBC" to the WDAC or AppLocker policy applied to this device. The binary is code-signed (verify with: Get-AuthenticodeSignature on claude.exe), so a publisher rule covers all install modes and version updates.\n\nIf publisher rules aren\'t available, add a path rule instead:\n  - AppLocker (3P):  %OSDRIVE%\\Users\\*\\AppData\\Local\\Claude-3p\\claude-code\\*\n  - AppLocker (1P):  %OSDRIVE%\\Users\\*\\AppData\\Roaming\\Claude\\claude-code\\*\n  - WDAC (3P):       %OSDRIVE%\\Users\\*\\AppData\\Local\\Claude-3p\\claude-code\\*\n  - WDAC (1P):       %OSDRIVE%\\Users\\*\\AppData\\Roaming\\Claude\\claude-code\\*\n    Note: WDAC ignores FilePath rules to user-writable locations unless the policy sets "Disabled:Runtime FilePath Rule Protection".\n\nIf Defender or other antivirus is blocking it, add an exclusion for the directory above or allow the detected item.'},cli_fastfail:{title:ict.cliCrashed,body:rct.tryAgainOrReport,retryHelps:!0},cli_shutdown_crash_benign:{title:ict.interrupted,body:rct.tryAgain,retryHelps:!0},dll_not_found:{title:ict.dllNotFound,body:rct.dllNotFound,retryHelps:!1},bun_crash:{title:ict.cliCrashed,body:rct.tryAgainOrReport,retryHelps:!0},auth_error:{title:ict.signedOut,body:rct.signIn,retryHelps:!1},github_auth:{title:ict.githubAuth,body:rct.githubAuth,retryHelps:!1},rate_limit:{title:ict.rateLimit,body:rct.rateLimit,retryHelps:!0},network_error:{title:ict.network,body:rct.network,retryHelps:!0},proxy_unreachable:{title:ict.proxyUnreachable,body:rct.proxyUnreachable,retryHelps:!0,showRawMessage:!0},network_service_dead:{title:ict.network,body:rct.networkServiceDead,retryHelps:!1},connection_refused:{title:ict.connectionRefused,body:rct.connectionRefused,retryHelps:!0},json_parse_error:{title:ict.unexpectedOutput,body:rct.restartApp,retryHelps:!0},filesystem_error:{title:ict.diskError,body:rct.