 responding",id:"hEM4asyIjl"})}]},{version:"1.9659.0",date:"2026-05-28",items:[{kind:"feat",text:EO({defaultMessage:"Claude Opus 4.8 is now available in the model picker",id:"BBdIiDX7hr"})},{kind:"feat",text:EO({defaultMessage:"Dynamic workflows let Claude fan out to many subagents on a single task",id:"8By5nlWG7I"})},{kind:"feat",text:EO({defaultMessage:"Your `WorktreeCreate` and `WorktreeRemove` hooks run for local sessions too \u2014 jj and Sapling setups can use worktree isolation",id:"de6C2Wzbse"})},{kind:"fix",text:EO({defaultMessage:"Searching file contents with `?` works for folders that aren't git repos",id:"CjsWsZhIqS"})},{kind:"fix",text:EO({defaultMessage:"Agents you define in your project's `.claude/agents` show up in the `@`-mention picker \u2014 and new ones appear without a restart",id:"JjAk5QHGza"})},{kind:"fix",text:EO({defaultMessage:"The PR bar finds your open PR even when your local branch name doesn't match the remote's",id:"dN1nhuij65"})},{kind:"fix",text:EO({defaultMessage:"Local video attachments play in the lightbox",id:"6p+YJwQX1o"})},{kind:"fix",text:EO({defaultMessage:"Starting a session on a branch works with macOS's built-in git",id:"VZeCi0uoZQ"})}]},{version:"1.9255.0",date:"2026-05-26",items:[{kind:"feat",text:EO({defaultMessage:"Split view now tiles into an adaptive grid \u2014 fit more sessions on a wide screen",id:"8vlKwS/pfy"})},{kind:"feat",text:EO({defaultMessage:"`/rename` renames the current session",id:"1iTX3zl2VF"})},{kind:"feat",text:EO({defaultMessage:"`/compact` now shows a marker in the transcript where context was compacted",id:"DAJYQ+55MZ"})},{kind:"feat",text:EO({defaultMessage:"Get a desktop notification when a routine run fails",id:"EHpObemtru"})},{kind:"improvement",text:EO({defaultMessage:"Remote Control shows as a badge in the title bar \u2014 click it to turn on or off",id:"M5bEHfdTTK"})},{kind:"improvement",text:EO({defaultMessage:"Click an image path in a response to preview it, even when it's outside your project folder",id:"iKUOEsCesf"})},{kind:"improvement",text:EO({defaultMessage:"Files you reference with `@` show as chips in the transcript, not just videos",id:"yNWdRZLhMh"})},{kind:"improvement",text:EO({defaultMessage:"Queued messages collapse into a stack \u2014 click to expand",id:"CCGNwmhrOs"})},{kind:"improvement",text:EO({defaultMessage:"Bash commands in the transcript are syntax-highlighted",id:"SzTj8drdXm"})},{kind:"improvement",text:EO({defaultMessage:"Your most recent sessions open faster from the sidebar",id:"XjwwQZQC/4"})},{kind:"fix",text:EO({defaultMessage:"Trackpad scrolling works over code and diff blocks",id:"kVrDy/v1HF"})},{kind:"fix",text:EO({defaultMessage:"The transcript stays where you scrolled instead of snapping back to the bottom",id:"rxO0yeSTDT"})},{kind:"fix",text:EO({defaultMessage:"Cancelling a queued message no longer interrupts the turn in progress",id:"P63xgHSKex"})},{kind:"fix",text:EO({defaultMessage:"Sessions with uncommitted changes are no longer auto-archived",id:"pNZUCYa4jA"})}]},{version:"1.8555.1",date:"2026-05-22",items:[{kind:"feat",text:EO({defaultMessage:"Open a session in its own window to work on sessions side by side \u2014 drag it out from the sidebar, or [[cmd+click]] it",id:"ZGvkX6TY8M"})},{kind:"feat",text:EO({defaultMessage:"Auto mode is now available on the Pro plan \u2014 Sonnet 4.6 is now supported, alongside Opus 4.7",id:"QnA8VUIvVj"})}]},{version:"1.8555.0",date:"2026-05-21",items:[{kind:"feat",text:EO({defaultMessage:"Videos you attach appear as chips in the transcript \u2014 click to play",id:"iRvW/9oStG"})},{kind:"feat",text:EO({defaultMessage:"Click a `#L5-L20` link in a response to highlight those lines in the file panel",id:"jPM3XrqpC3"})},{kind:"improvement",text:EO({defaultMessage:"`file://` paths in responses are now clickable",id:"fCqsyH2TG3"})},{kind:"fix",text:EO({defaultMessage:"Remote sessions reconnect on their own after sleep or network changes",id:"ZWsDyQeFPt"})}]},{version:"1.8089.0",date:"2